{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8ea3a2e9-34c4-4a41-bdd7-c6845df18fe6",
    "name": "Card Issuer API",
    "description": "Colección para los endpoints implementados: salud, autenticación, recursos, batches de estado y verificación de autorización mTLS. Configure base_url y, si corresponde, authorization_base_url para el entorno objetivo. Las credenciales iniciales son exclusivamente las cuentas seed de desarrollo documentadas en database/TEST-CREDENTIALS.md.\n\nLos POST de autenticación no requieren Idempotency-Key. Login y refresh devuelven access_token; los scripts de prueba lo guardan en la variable de colección access_token. El refresh token nunca se devuelve en JSON: Postman debe conservar la cookie __Host-card-issuer-refresh de login. Para una API HTTP local, use el administrador de cookies de Postman o configure HTTPS, ya que la cookie es Secure.\n\nTodos los cambios de la Public Resource API requieren Idempotency-Key. Las solicitudes de esta colección usan {{$guid}} para generar una clave nueva en cada envío. Ejecute Login antes de Public Resource API y ejecute sus carpetas en orden para guardar los IDs creados. La verificación de autorización usa mTLS y el bank_transaction_reference como clave de replay; no usa bearer token ni Idempotency-Key. Para Compose local, base_url es http://localhost:8080 y authorization_base_url es https://localhost:8443. Configure el certificado .local/authorization-pki/bank-client.pem, su clave bank-client-key.pem y la CA server-ca.pem; esos archivos son locales, ignorados por Git y no deben salir de la máquina.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "issuer_operator", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Test-Issuer-Operator!2026", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "new_password", "value": "ChangeThisPassword!2026", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "request_id", "value": "90000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bank_id", "value": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "provisioned_bank_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "client_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "account_reference_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "card_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "replacement_card_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "expiry_run_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "expiry_item_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "card_status_batch_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authorization_base_url", "value": "https://localhost:8443", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bank_transaction_reference", "value": "postman-authorization-{{$guid}}", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authorization_pan", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authorization_cvv", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Live",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health/live",
            "description": "No requiere parámetros, cuerpo ni autenticación. Devuelve 200 con { status: ok } cuando el proceso está activo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health/ready",
            "description": "No requiere parámetros, cuerpo ni autenticación. Devuelve 200 con { status: ready } cuando las tres conexiones de base de datos están disponibles, o 503 con not_ready."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns an access token', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Request-ID", "value": "{{request_id}}", "description": "UUID canónico opcional. Si se omite o no es válido, la API genera uno." }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Cuerpo requerido: username y password. No tiene parámetros de ruta o query. Devuelve access_token, token_type, expires_at y user; también establece la cookie HttpOnly __Host-card-issuer-refresh."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh access token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('rotates the access token', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Request-ID", "value": "{{request_id}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/refresh",
            "description": "No requiere cuerpo ni parámetros. Requiere la cookie __Host-card-issuer-refresh creada por Login; Postman debe conservarla en su cookie jar. La respuesta rota esa cookie y devuelve un access token nuevo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Current user",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "X-Request-ID", "value": "{{request_id}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/me",
            "description": "No requiere cuerpo ni parámetros. Requiere Authorization: Bearer <access token>. Devuelve exclusivamente username, status y role."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Request-ID", "value": "{{request_id}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"current_password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"new_password\": \"{{new_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/me/password",
            "description": "Cuerpo requerido: current_password y new_password; no tiene parámetros de ruta o query. La nueva contraseña debe tener 13+ caracteres Unicode, una mayúscula, un número y un símbolo/puntuación. Devuelve 204 e invalida las familias de refresh; actualice password y new_password antes de volver a ejecutar Login."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Request-ID", "value": "{{request_id}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/logout",
            "description": "No requiere cuerpo ni parámetros. Usa la cookie __Host-card-issuer-refresh si está presente, revoca su sesión y siempre limpia la cookie. Devuelve 204 incluso si no hay cookie o es inválida."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Public Resource API",
      "description": "Las rutas de recursos requieren un bearer token emitido por Login. Las operaciones que escriben usan una clave de idempotencia nueva; para comprobar un replay, reenvíe manualmente una misma solicitud con el mismo Idempotency-Key.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [ { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" } ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Bank directory",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List banks", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks", "description": "Solo issuer_operator. Colección cursor con data y next_cursor." } },
            {
              "name": "Provision bank",
              "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('provisions a bank', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('provisioned_bank_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ],
              "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"bank_reference\": \"postman-{{$guid}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Postman Bank\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks", "description": "Solo issuer_operator. Crea y activa una ruta de banco en el shard configurado." }
            },
            { "name": "Get bank", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}" } },
            { "name": "Patch bank", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Bank (Postman)\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}", "description": "Solo issuer_operator. bank_reference es inmutable." } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Staff administration",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List users", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users", "description": "Solo issuer_operator. No expone hashes ni credenciales." } },
            {
              "name": "Create issuer readonly user",
              "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('creates a staff user', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ],
              "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"postman_{{$guid}}\",\n  \"password\": \"PostmanUser!2026\",\n  \"role\": \"issuer_readonly\",\n  \"entity_id\": \"\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users" }
            },
            { "name": "Get user", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users/{{user_id}}" } },
            { "name": "Patch user role", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"issuer_readonly\",\n  \"entity_id\": null\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users/{{user_id}}" } },
            { "name": "Set user password", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"new_password\": \"PostmanReset!2026\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users/{{user_id}}:set-password" } },
            { "name": "Disable user", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users/{{user_id}}:disable", "description": "Deshabilita al usuario creado arriba." } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reference data",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Card products",
              "item": [
                { "name": "List products", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-products?page_size=50" } },
                { "name": "Create product", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('creates a product', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"product_code\": \"postman-{{$guid}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Postman product\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"configuration\": { \"currency\": \"USD\" }\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-products" } },
                { "name": "Get product", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-products/{{product_id}}" } },
                { "name": "Patch product", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman product v2\",\n  \"configuration\": { \"currency\": \"USD\", \"spend_limit\": 1000 }\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-products/{{product_id}}", "description": "Configuration cambia configuration_version; product_code es inmutable." } }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Clients",
              "item": [
                { "name": "List clients", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/clients?page_size=50" } },
                { "name": "Create client", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('creates a client', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('client_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"external_client_ref\": \"postman-{{$guid}}\",\n  \"display_name\": \"Postman client\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/clients" } },
                { "name": "Get client", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/clients/{{client_id}}" } },
                { "name": "Patch client", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"display_name\": \"Postman client v2\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/clients/{{client_id}}", "description": "external_client_ref es inmutable." } }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Account references",
              "item": [
                { "name": "List account references", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/account-references?page_size=50" } },
                { "name": "Create account reference", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('creates an account reference', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('account_reference_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"client_id\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n  \"external_account_ref\": \"postman-{{$guid}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/account-references" } },
                { "name": "Get account reference", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/account-references/{{account_reference_id}}" } },
                { "name": "Rebind account reference", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"client_id\": \"{{client_id}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/account-references/{{account_reference_id}}", "description": "Solo es válido si la integridad referencial permite el rebinding. external_account_ref es inmutable." } }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cards and operations",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List cards with filters", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards?client_id={{client_id}}&account_reference_id={{account_reference_id}}&product_id={{product_id}}&status=issued&page_size=50", "description": "Filtros exactos admitidos: client_id, account_reference_id, product_id y status. La respuesta es una colección cursor." } },
            { "name": "Issue card", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('issues a card', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('card_id', pm.response.json().card.id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"client_id\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n  \"account_reference_id\": \"{{account_reference_id}}\",\n  \"product_id\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"Initial issue through Postman\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards", "description": "Issuer o bank_operator asignado. La respuesta inicial contiene credentials.pan y credentials.cvv transitorios; no se guardan automáticamente y no aparecen en un replay de idempotencia." } },
            { "name": "Get card", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}" } },
            { "name": "Activate card", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Activate through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}:activate" } },
            { "name": "Suspend card", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Suspend through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}:suspend" } },
            { "name": "Resume card", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Resume through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}:resume" } },
            { "name": "Replace card", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('replaces a card', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('replacement_card_id', pm.response.json().card.id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Replace through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}:replace", "description": "Issuer o bank_operator asignado, y solo desde active o suspended. La sucesora conserva cliente, cuenta y producto; la respuesta inicial incluye credenciales transitorias." } },
            { "name": "Activate replacement", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Activate replacement through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{replacement_card_id}}:activate", "description": "La activación cierra atómicamente la tarjeta predecesora." } },
            { "name": "Card history", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}/history?page_size=50" } },
            { "name": "Card operations", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{card_id}}/operations?page_size=50" } },
            { "name": "Close replacement card", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Close through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/cards/{{replacement_card_id}}:close" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Card-status batches",
          "description": "Issuer y bank_operator asignado pueden crear, ejecutar, cancelar y reintentar batches. Cree un draft, revíselo y ejecute el comando explícito. Las listas usan cursor y page_size (1-200).",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List batches", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches?page_size=50", "description": "Devuelve una colección cursor de batches visibles para el banco." } },
            { "name": "Create draft", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('creates a card-status batch draft', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('card_status_batch_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"target_status\": \"suspended\",\n  \"reason\": \"Postman review batch\",\n  \"card_ids\": [\n    \"{{card_id}}\"\n  ]\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches", "description": "Crea un draft inmutable. target_status admite active, suspended o closed; card_ids debe contener entre 1 y 200 UUIDs únicos del banco." } },
            { "name": "Get batch", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches/{{card_status_batch_id}}", "description": "Devuelve el batch, incluyendo links.execute." } },
            { "name": "List batch items", "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches/{{card_status_batch_id}}/items?page_size=50", "description": "Devuelve una colección cursor de ítems del batch." } },
            { "name": "Execute batch", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches/{{card_status_batch_id}}:execute", "description": "Despacha un draft y devuelve 202 con estado queued. El executor procesa el batch de forma asíncrona." } },
            { "name": "Cancel batch", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches/{{card_status_batch_id}}:cancel", "description": "Cancela únicamente batches draft o queued sin lease de procesamiento; devuelve 200." } },
            { "name": "Retry terminal batch", "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('creates a retry draft', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); pm.collectionVariables.set('card_status_batch_id', pm.response.json().id); });" ] } } ], "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-status-batches/{{card_status_batch_id}}:retry", "description": "Solo failed o cancelled. Crea un nuevo draft enlazado, guarda su ID y exige una ejecución posterior." } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Expiry retry",
          "item": [
            { "name": "Retry expiry item", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"reason\": \"Manual retry through Postman\" }", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/banks/{{bank_id}}/card-expiry-runs/{{expiry_run_id}}/items/{{expiry_item_id}}:retry", "description": "Solo issuer_operator. Reintenta manualmente un ítem elegible y devuelve 202 con el estado pending." } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Authorization verification (mTLS)",
      "description": "Servicio independiente de verificación de credenciales, no expuesto por la Public Resource API. Antes de enviarlo, configure en Postman un certificado cliente válido, su clave privada y la CA del servicio para authorization_base_url. La identidad del banco se deriva exclusivamente del certificado cliente; no agregue un bank_id al cuerpo. Este request contiene datos de tarjeta transitorios: copie pan/cvv de la respuesta inicial de Issue card únicamente en un entorno de prueba y limpie las variables authorization_pan y authorization_cvv después de usarlo.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verify credentials",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns a safe authorization decision', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.bank_transaction_reference).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.decision_id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.decision).to.be.oneOf(['approved', 'declined']);",
                  "    pm.expect(body).not.to.have.property('pan');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).not.to.have.property('cvv');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"bank_transaction_reference\": \"{{bank_transaction_reference}}\",\n  \"pan\": \"{{authorization_pan}}\",\n  \"cvv\": \"{{authorization_cvv}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{authorization_base_url}}/v1/authorization-verifications",
            "description": "Requiere TLS 1.3 mutuo y no usa bearer token ni Idempotency-Key. bank_transaction_reference debe ser no vacío y tener como máximo 256 caracteres; pan debe tener 13-19 dígitos y cvv 3-4 dígitos. Repetir la misma referencia devuelve la decisión segura original sin volver a verificar credenciales. La respuesta solo contiene bank_transaction_reference, decision_id y decision (approved o declined)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
